#31000
Entrance to Brown University~
A squared pier faced in brushed steel separates the `wwaiting bench`x from the
near line of passage. The lower wall finish is sturdier than the panels above,
built to survive bags and passing coats. The arrangement gives an arrival
somewhere to pause before deciding how to become part of the room.`x
~
