#31001
Brown U Med Ed - 222 Richmond Street~
Old repairs stitch the `wroad`x in crooked bands of tar. Traffic has ground
the pavement smooth through the middle, leaving a crumble of grit along the
edges. A faint rubber smell clings to the surface; weeds have taken root in
cracks too narrow for a tire to reach.`x
