#31003
Ragona Community Center Hallway~
A vertical seam divides the left-hand finish into two unequal panels of
brushed steel. The upper finish has a finer texture than the more durable
strip close to shoe height. The clear passage carries sound farther than the
close walls first suggest.`x
~
